#: ../../source/Models_Equations/HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam.rst:15
msgid ""
"The solver is named :code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam`, which is "
"designed to resolve fluid flow within submarine hydrothermal circulation "
"systems. The hydrothermal fluid flow is governed by Darcy's law (Eqn. "
":eq:`eq:darcy`), mass continuity (Eqn. :eq:`eq:conti`) and energy "
"conservation (Eqn. :eq:`eq:temperature`) equations shown below,"
msgstr ""
"求解器的名字为\\ :code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam`\\ "
"，用于求解海底热液循环系统中热液流体流动的动力学问题。热液流体流动规律的控制方程为：达西定律(方程\\ :eq:`eq:darcy`), "
"连续性方程 (方程\\ :eq:`eq:conti`) 和能量守恒方程 (方程\\ :eq:`eq:temperature`),"

