"\\varepsilon \\rho_f \\left( \\beta_f \\frac{\\partial p}{\\partial t} - "
"\\alpha_f \\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial t} \\right) = \\nabla \\cdot "
"\\left( \\rho_f \\frac{k}{\\mu_f} (\\nabla p - \\rho_f \\vec{g}) \\right)"
