"(\\varepsilon \\rho_f C_{pf} + (1-\\varepsilon)\\rho_r "
"C_{pr})\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial t} = \\nabla \\cdot (\\lambda_r "
"\\nabla T) - \\rho_f C_{pf} \\vec{U}\\cdot \\nabla T + \\frac{\\mu_f}{k} "
"\\parallel \\vec{U} \\parallel ^2 - \\left( \\frac{\\partial ln "
"\\rho_f}{\\partial ln T} \\right)_p \\frac{Dp}{Dt}"
