#: ../../source/Models_Equations/HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam.rst:162
msgid ""
"The available boundary conditions (BCs) of temperature and pressure for "
":code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam` are presented below."
msgstr "求解器\\ :code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam`\\ 可用的边界条件列举如下。"

#: ../../source/Models_Equations/HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam.rst:165
msgid ""
"Syntax of all the input files of OpenFOAM, thus of |foam| is C++ style. "
"The basic form of a boundary condition can be written as following "
"dictionary structure,"
msgstr ""
"OpenFOAM所有的输入文件的语法格式都是类似于C++的，当然\\ |foam|\\ 也继承了这种特性。 "
"边界条件的定义是一种字典类型，其基本格式如下"

#: ../../source/Models_Equations/HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam.rst:178
msgid ""
"where :code:`type` and :code:`value` are always compulsive keys, and "
"sometime the :code:`value` key is just a placeholder but have to be "
"there. :code:`option*` represents some optional parameters for a special "
